<description>WCAP-ATUL Aluminum Electrolytic Capacitors
Low Leakage &amp; Long Life +105 °C

Characteristics
Low leakage current and long life product series
Mounting style: THT Radial
Recommended soldering: Wave soldering

Applications
Durable battery applications
Filtering
Smoothing
Energy storage
Coupling
e.g. Switched-mode power supply, AC/DC converter, adapter, charger, digital camera

Details see: www.we-online.com/en/components/products/WCAP-ATUL

Updated by Ella 2025-10-28
2025(C) Würth Elektronik</description>
